        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86415, Modern T-Curve Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe T-Curve Cabinet Pull has an interesting shape that adds a since of flow to any space. The Emtek 86415 T-Curve Pull can be mounted in any orientation on your lightweight doors and drawers. The  Modern T-Curve Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the installation hardware. Choose from an array of contemporary finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86415-specifications.gif?v=1704354762\" width=\"600\" height=\"141\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86415 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/curve-bar-cabinet-pull-emtek-86416\"><b>Curve Bar Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the T-Curve Kitchen Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-mod-86415-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354683\" width=\"427\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
